<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>IcantTapstrafe</Major>
    <Description>Hello everyone.
I made an macro for apex legends.
This macro can help you a lot by getting better at movement in apex.

1. Bind the macro on a Mousebutton or space
2. HOLD the Button you binded it on.
3. The macro will autojump for you and moving you forward.
4. Enjoy your tapstrafes.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 44 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>